# L1-OUT-003: reordering is confined to runs of CONSECUTIVE equal timestamps.
# Two separate ties, each at its own TIME_STAMP, with RTs descending across the
# whole file. Each tie sorts internally; the timestamps themselves are never
# reordered, so the second tie's rows never migrate ahead of the first tie's.

